    "created_at": "2023-03-02T12:55:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-02T12:55:47Z",
    "body": "My findings on linux/fish (prompt has $fill in front of $status):\r\n- each pipe element reduces the available space for $fill with a **fixed 27 chars**\r\n- base length if the one for when there is 1 or no pipe (`--pipestatus=\"\"` or `--pipestatus=\"0\"`)\r\n- when there are 2 pipes (`--pipestatus=\"0 0\"`) the fill decreases by 54 (2*27)\r\n- when there are 3 pipes (`--pipestatus=\"0 0 0\"`) the fill decreases by 81 (3*27)\r\n- when there are 4 pipes (`--pipestatus=\"0 0 0 0\"`) the fill decreases by 108 (4*27)\r\n\r\n```\r\n╭─------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ [ERROR] at 14:35:58\r\n╭─------------------------------------------------------------------- [] | [] => [ERROR] at 14:38:36\r\n╭─------------------------------------------------------------------- [] | [] => [ERROR] at 14:38:36x________yx________yx________yx________yx________yx__4 [54 chars less - 2*27]\r\n╭─----------------------------------- [] | [] | [] => [ERROR] at 14:38:40\r\n╭─----------------------------------- [] | [] | [] => [ERROR] at 14:38:40x________yx________yx_____7 [27 chars less - 1*27]\r\n╭─--- [] | [] | [] | [] => [ERROR] at 14:41:05\r\n╭─--- [] | [] | [] | [] => [ERROR] at 14:41:05x________yx________yx_____7 [27 chars less - 1*27]\r\n```",
